C3/C4/C7 chain inserts lines into both `SignUpFlow.tsx` and `auth-flow-integration.test.tsx`
and every number below its own insertion point moves. **The class members, swept and each
fixed in its own step:** `S02-S17`, `S02-S18`, `S02-S22`, `S02-S23`, `S02-S25`, `S02-S31`,
`S02-S32`, and the C3 row of §Per-cluster boundaries.

