  (`ARCH-REV-S02-r1` N6; C3 and C4 both edit this file): inside the function
  `submitRegistration`, **after** the single statement `const data = new FormData(form);` and
  **before** the single `await client.register(` call, read
  `data.get("adult-affirmed") === "on"` and `data.get("privacy-accepted") === "on"` off
  **that same `FormData` instance** and `return` without calling `register` if either is false.
  **Count arms:** `grep -c 'const data = new FormData(form);' apps/ui/components/SignUpFlow.tsx`
  → `1` and `grep -c 'client.register(' …` → `1`, both before and after. Measured at base
