  `authRoutes.source-test.mjs:48` bans (that guard reads `SignUpFlow.tsx` only, and `Privacy
  Policy` is not `privacy notice`).
  **Property:** a keyboard-only user can focus and `PageDown` the policy — the only way such a
  user can satisfy R15 — and the region announces what it contains. **RED before, GREEN after.
