- **S02-S56 · Esc closes the modal AND NOTHING ELSE ACTS ON THAT EVENT (the B3 pin).**
  Serves R08, R14, R17. Edits both files.
  **Test:** fill the email, recovery-email and password fields; click `adult-affirmed`; open
