-- live, at base: '--scrim:'=0 (expect 2)  'consent-ui S02' markers=0 (expect 2)   -> 1
-- known-GOOD synthetic (post-merge): s01=2 s02=2                                  -> 0
-- mutant: the merge lost S01's block  s01=0 s02=2                                 -> 1
-- mutant: the merge lost S02's block  s01=2 s02=0                                 -> 1
