`node scratchpad/arch-consent-s02/env-probe.mjs`, WCAG 2.2 relative luminance (the same formula
as `tests/support/contrast.ts:1-11`), disabled `I have read it` composited over the footer's
`--shell` ground, both modes:

```
   opacity 0.45 : Terracotta #969189/#f4efe8 2.74   |   Chamber #80796e/#1c1813 4.10
   opacity 0.50 : Terracotta #8c8880/#f4f0e9 3.11   |   Chamber #8a8478/#1b1713 4.80
   opacity 0.55 : Terracotta #827e76/#f5f0e9 3.57   |   Chamber #948e82/#1a1612 5.53
   opacity 0.60 : Terracotta #78746c/#f5f1ea 4.13   |   Chamber #9f988b/#1a1612 6.29
